day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/657/","text":"There have been some misleading stories going around today about our plans in Hawaii, so I want to clear this up.\n \nI posted last month about how Priscilla and I bought some land in Hawaii. We want...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103427714244971","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-656","post_id":"656","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10103427282719751&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-19","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/656/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-655","post_id":"655","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103425553874371","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/655/","text":"Heading back home after a great few days in Texas. Today we drove down to Waco and stopped in smaller towns along the way. \n\nI had lunch with community leaders in Waxahachie who shared their pride in...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103425553874371","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-654","post_id":"654","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10103423046494181&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/654/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-653","post_id":"653","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10103419813453221&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/653/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-652","post_id":"652","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103419296953291","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/652/","text":"The first state I'm visiting this year is Texas. I'm here in Dallas for work, but I'm also taking time to meet members of our Texas community over the next few days as part of my Year of Travel...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103419296953291","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-929","post_id":"929","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103412390219441/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-14","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/929/","text":"You can experience anything in virtual reality -- like getting a tour of the White House from the President and First Lady. This 360 video was made by The White House, Félix & Paul Studios and our...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103412390219441/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-651","post_id":"651","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10103410869691591&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/651/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-928","post_id":"928","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103400670475901/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-10","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/928/","text":"It's Beast's 6th birthday! A few weeks ago, an artist at Oculus designed and printed a 3D sculpture in VR. Beast was pretty confused, but I love that we have the technology and culture where people...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10103400670475901/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-650","post_id":"650","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10103400793718921&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-10","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/650/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-649","post_id":"649","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10103398844570031&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/649/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-648","post_id":"648","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103387479341041","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-04","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/648/","text":"I've really enjoyed doing personal challenges with our community -- like running and reading -- and I'd love for just as many people to join me in traveling this year.\n\nI'm calling this challenge A...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103387479341041","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-647","post_id":"647","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103385178272401","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-01-03","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/647/","text":"Every year I take on a personal challenge to learn new things and grow outside of my work. In recent years, I've run 365 miles, built a simple AI for my home, read 25 books and learned Mandarin.\n\nMy...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10103385178272401","text_truncated":false}]